      "message": "Is there an easy way to auto set this config? If not, then you can ignore my suggestion, but I am thinking if there is a need for this to be configurable if this will be only used by one module at a time. Maybe basing on the board value? If servo, then define 4, otherwise, #error board not supported? Or just an error somewhere if the length is not defined?",
